                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a hard game to recommend, which is a real shame because this is a game with a vision. If the aesthetics of an eastern bloc synthwave racer are enough to carry the game for you, then it's worth playing. If not, then race-ending bugs, jank physics, inconsistent performance, and the cutthroat story mode necessary to unlock cities will test your patience. These are things that could be fixed. The game deserves a remaster.",
